# Web3Forms access key — used by the Contact page and the "Contact Us" popup
# to deliver form submissions to your inbox. Get a free key at
# https://web3forms.com (no signup beyond confirming your email).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your real key there.
# .env.local is gitignored (matched by "*.local") and is never committed.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
